Third-party models
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This software downloads and runs the following pre-trained models. They are NOT
distributed as part of this repository. Each is fetched from the Hugging Face Hub
by scripts/00_download_resources.sh or at first use, and each remains subject to
its own license. Consult the model pages for the authoritative and current terms.

  BAAI/bge-m3
      Role:    chunk and entity content embeddings (1024-dim)
      License: MIT
      https://huggingface.co/BAAI/bge-m3

  ncbi/MedCPT-Query-Encoder
      Role:    entity label and n-gram embeddings (768-dim)
      License: public domain (U.S. National Library of Medicine / NCBI)
      https://huggingface.co/ncbi/MedCPT-Query-Encoder

  minishlab/potion-base-32M
      Role:    sentence embeddings for semantic chunking
      License: MIT
      https://huggingface.co/minishlab/potion-base-32M

