Data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The databases, papers and curated resources that this software downloads and
processes are not part of this repository and are not covered by the license
above. Each resource (NCBI Gene, CTD, KEGG, Reactome, MSigDB, Gene Ontology,
Cell Ontology, Uberon, NCBI Taxonomy, Semantic Scholar, Europe PMC) is subject
to the license and terms of use of its provider. data/papers.tsv lists
identifiers and bibliographic metadata of papers. The full texts of the papers
remain subject to their publishers' terms.
